 "equipment_type": "UPS (uninterruptible power supply)",
 "applies_to": "Liebert APS modular UPS systems.",
 "summary": "The Liebert APS UPS reports to a BMS through a Liebert IntelliSlot card (BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP). Analog Values carry input, bypass, output and battery measurements, Binary Values carry UPS events, and Multi-state Values carry system status, output source and settings. Objects are created when the card discovers the UPS.",
